# BusyBox init (/init is BusyBox). rcS brings up the Chumby's drivers and
# devices; stick runs a neochumby stick's hook, in the background, its
# output on the console; the shell on ttyS0 comes back when it exits.
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
::once:/etc/init.d/stick
ttyS0::respawn:-/bin/sh
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/bin/umount -a -r
